      "@type": "kto:Theory",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Stakeholder Theory",
      "skos:definition": "A theory of the firm and of management, associated with R. Edward Freeman, holding that a company should be understood and managed as a set of relationships with all groups that affect or are affected by its objectives, not only its shareholders.",
